  "_comment": [
    "The controlled vocabulary for the guide: categories and tags, each with the label a",
    "guest sees in every language we serve. Read by scripts/build-guide.mjs and by the app.",
    "",
    "Tags are an allowlist, not free text. Left open, a filter fills with near-duplicate",
    "chips (Japanese / Japanese Ramen / Thai / Thai Fusion / Fusion) and nobody notices",
    "until a guest is looking at it. The build fails on anything not listed here, so adding",
    "a tag is a reviewable change rather than a typo.",
    "",
    "Families decide behaviour on the page: food is filterable, dietary and practical show",
    "on the card only. Narrowing the whole guide to the cash-only places is not a question a",
    "guest asks.",
    "",
    "A tag listed here and used by nothing costs nothing: GUIDE_TAGS only ever contains tags",
    "in use, so unused entries sit ready for the next place.",
    "",
    "Adding one: a line here, plus an entry on the sheet's Vocabulary tab so the dropdown",
    "offers it. Translations are required; a missing one falls back to English."
  ],
